classDiagram
    class Angular入口["当前 Angular 入口：选择时间并提交"]
    class ShellService["当前 handler/service：命名命令或 binding 转换"]
    class CommandPort["当前 CommandPort：`im_create_schedule`"]
    class Tauri命令["当前 Tauri command：协议转换"]
    class Helix处理["当前 Helix action/query handler（G08）"]
    class Tick["当前 `Tick`"]
    class Effect["当前 `Effect`：`http_write`、`storage_upsert`、`projection`"]
    class 持久化["当前 Persist handler：channel_schedule"]
    class V1投影["切换前 V1 projector：`channel.row.v1`"]
    class V1帧["切换前 V1：`InteractionFrameV1`，`schemaVersion=1`"]
    class V1节点["切换前 V1：`RenderNode/v1`，仍可达"]
    class V1解码["切换前 V1 consumer：`normalizeLegacyFrame`"]
    class SurfaceRuntime["当前 `ProjectionStore/SurfaceRuntime`"]
    class 组件["当前组件：message-ui-schedule-dialog、message-ui-overlay-host"]
    Angular入口 --> ShellService
    ShellService --> CommandPort
    CommandPort --> Tauri命令
    Tauri命令 --> Helix处理
    Helix处理 --> Tick
    Tick --> Effect
    Effect --> 持久化
    持久化 --> V1投影
    V1投影 --> V1帧
    V1帧 --> V1节点
    V1节点 --> V1解码
    V1解码 --> SurfaceRuntime
    SurfaceRuntime --> 组件
